 doesn&amp;#39;t inundate me with Windows or Vista glare, it&amp;#39;s not over the top, it&amp;#39;s just funny.&amp;nbsp; I mean, Bill Gates just wiggled his rear end on &lt;em&gt;national television!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;I guess I&amp;#39;m just easy to please.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style="clear:both;"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;img src="http://cromwellhaus.com/aggbug.aspx?PostID=743" width="1" height="1"&gt;&lt;div class="feedflare"&gt;
